# Environment variables — this repo is public. The Supabase config
# previously committed here was safe to expose (publishable/anon key, not
# secret), but MongoDB connection strings, the Google OAuth Client Secret,
# and the session JWT signing secret must never be committed. Copy
# .env.example to .env locally and fill in real values there.
